# Бой

**FSM:** choice → ready → countdown → play ⇄ **emergency** → explosion → ready|result. First card at countdown end if null. After boom: next_card→next_player→ready, or match end / overtime.

**Overtime knockout:** deck empty after boom → unique min score = `result`. Tie on min → `enter_overtime()` (non-leaders `eliminated_at=0`), splash `OVERTIME_*` with remaining/out leaderboard rows (`GameResultOverlay.build_rank_row`), roster button hidden, extra cards until one active. Each OT boom: +1 and out, splash `PLAYER_ELIMINATED`. Rank: score ASC, `eliminated_at` DESC. Splash: `BattleSplashOverlay` via `ev_battle_splash`, hold `explosion` until tap/~8s board or ~3.5s knockout. Tutorial skips OT.

**UI init trap:** FSM starts in `initialize()` before child `_ready`. HUD + `game_input` MUST `_sync_to_current_state()` in `_ready`.

**Layout:** dial@`RoundWord` · player pill on lower dial · `TableHintBanner`@`PlayerName` · pass hint y≈1410 (`GameActionHints`).

**HUD:** SyllableCard — fitted single-line center text · hints via `TableHintBanner` · PlayerStrip on dial.

State UI: choice/ready/countdown/play share dial layout · ready=«Готовы?»+StartRoundButton · play=full HUD.

**Input** (`game_input.gd`): `mouse_filter=IGNORE`. PLAY: multi-touch pass — next only when **all** fingers up within **0.3s**; hold longer = invalid · tap→next + sparks. **Emergency** button (PLAY only) → `EMERGENCY` state, pause game+audio, overlay to re-pick current player · continue → `try_add_bonus_bomb_time()`. RESULT→`GameResultOverlay` «В МЕНЮ» button (10s reveal, haptics, no tap-skip).

**Pass sparks:** `pass_bomb_spark_layer.gd` on `ScaledContent` — radial additive fire burst at touch (one-shot CPUParticles2D).

**Emergency:** `BattleEmergencyOverlay` + `EmergencyState` · `PlayerSelectionWidget.set_emergency_mode()` · `GameBattleChrome/EmergencyButton` · icon `icon_emergency.svg`.

**Battle lobby overlay:** `BattlePlayerLobbyOverlay` — edit roster mid-game · hidden/locked in overtime · Done = confirm if roster ok else click · reuses `PlayerSelectionWidget` + `StartActionButton`.

**Visual:** `GameBombBackground` — player-color backdrop · `DisplayBomb`/`BombDialGlass` dial glass (`BombDialLayout` cover-scale 800@138,550) · hides with bomb on explosion/result · alert pulse · bomb flash/shake on explosion · `ExplosionEffect` · `GameResultOverlay` full-screen winner tint, rank scroll only, celebration particles.

**Audio:** gameplay → `GameSound` · UI buttons → `UiSounds` → `audio.mdc`.

**Core:** `game_manager.gd` `game_session.gd` `game_sound.gd` `word_condition.gd`

**Match length:** deck size from `account.game_time_minutes` via `GameSession.rebuild_card_deck()` · refreshed on `setup_session`, `start_round`, and `ev_game_time_changed`. OT does not rebuild the deck.
